# Runtime secrets and state. paari_signing_key.pem is an UNENCRYPTED Ed25519
# private key: committing it would let anyone mint Paari-issued credentials,
# and every token issued under the committed key stays forgeable forever.
*.pem
*.key

# Databases (runtime + test fixtures)
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db.pre-*

# Local secret files (live E2E / deployment env)
.env
.env.*
# ...except the two files that must be shared: `.env.example` is what a
# contributor copies, and `.env.test` is the suite's declared baseline. A
# gitignored test configuration is a file that only exists on one machine.
!.env.example
!.env.test
*_env.ps1

# Runtime server logs (regenerated on every local run)
*.log

# Tooling caches
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.benchmarks/
.mimocode/

# Local-only: these carry a real Razorpay test key id and stay out of the repo
/checkout_pay.html
/evidence_live_e2e_2026-09-19.md

# Virtualenvs
venv/
.venv/